it offers learners the opportunity to apply their knowledge and understanding to adapt an existing
component, element or part of the engineering outcome that they produced for Unit 1 (page 19).

Unit 3 introduces learners to a range of considerations that impact on engineering design and how
modern engineering has had an impact on modern day life at home, work and in society in general
(page 25).

